  m_Name: New QR Code Data 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafetyTraining.QRCodeData
  qrCodeID: Topraklama Kablosu
  title: Topraklama Kablosu
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Bu topraklama kablosu, y\xFCksek gerilim testleri s\u0131ras\u0131nda
    g\xFCvenli\u011Fi sa\u011Flamak amac\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Test sonras\u0131nda
    kabloda kalabilecek art\u0131k elektrik y\xFCk\xFCn\xFC g\xFCvenli \u015Fekilde
    topra\u011Fa aktararak kapasitif enerjinin bo\u015Falt\u0131lmas\u0131n\u0131
    sa\u011Flar. B\xF6ylece hem test arac\u0131n\u0131n hem de saha personelinin
    olas\u0131 elektriksel risklere kar\u015F\u0131 korunmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131
    olur. \xD6zellikle VLF, PD ve benzeri y\xFCksek gerilim testlerinin ard\u0131ndan
    g\xFCvenli \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma ko\u015Fullar\u0131n\u0131n olu\u015Fturulmas\u0131
    i\xE7in kritik \xF6neme sahiptir."
